<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-STUTTGART OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STUTTGART OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stuttgart Open first round results on Monday:</p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) beat Alex Radulescu (Germany) 6-7 (1-7) 7-6 (7-3) 6-4</p>
<p>Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) beat Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany) 6-1 7-5</p>
<p>Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) beat Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 4-6 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat Alex Corretja (Spain) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Stefan Edberg (Sweden) beat Tim Henman (Britain) 6-4 6-2  </p>
<p>Stefan Edberg (Sweden) beat Tim Henman (Britain) 6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
